+        "query-window-publisher-loss", incarnation.node_id, incarnation.node_pid,
+        incarnation.registration_epoch, 1, 7, protocol.NodeDeathReason.PROCESS_EXIT,
+        "registered fixture publisher loss boundary",
+    )
